    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s2_hist_ev_txt",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 493,
      "width": 1040,
      "height": 85,
      "text": "1. Trajectory analysis  (phase: exploration / exploitation / saturation)\n2. Pattern extraction from CAMPAIGN_JOURNAL  (cross >= 3 rounds)\n3. Assumption audit  (load-bearing + unverified → flag CRITICAL)\n4. Bottleneck diagnosis  (model / optimizer / data / eval / features)\n5. Frontier update  (append new classes to UNEXPLORED_TECHNIQUES.md)",
      "originalText": "1. Trajectory analysis  (phase: exploration / exploitation / saturation)\n2. Pattern extraction from CAMPAIGN_JOURNAL  (cross >= 3 rounds)\n3. Assumption audit  (load-bearing + unverified → flag CRITICAL)\n4. Bottleneck diagnosis  (model / optimizer / data / eval / features)\n5. Frontier update  (append new classes to UNEXPLORED_TECHNIQUES.md)",
