    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s2_plan_ev_txt",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 707,
      "width": 1040,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "1. Read all inputs  (contracts, state, historian output, PRIORS)\n2. Query results_query + dead_ends_query for campaign history\n3. Assumption-aware novelty check  (critical unverified → prioritize A_validate)\n4. Pattern-informed strategy  (read PATTERN_BOOK, check for collisions)\n5. Pre-selection reasoning:  2-3 candidates with Expected Δ estimates\n6. Write NEXT_EXPERIMENT.md  (hypothesis + action_type + evidence from memory)",
      "originalText": "1. Read all inputs  (contracts, state, historian output, PRIORS)\n2. Query results_query + dead_ends_query for campaign history\n3. Assumption-aware novelty check  (critical unverified → prioritize A_validate)\n4. Pattern-informed strategy  (read PATTERN_BOOK, check for collisions)\n5. Pre-selection reasoning:  2-3 candidates with Expected Δ estimates\n6. Write NEXT_EXPERIMENT.md  (hypothesis + action_type + evidence from memory)",
