    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s3_exec_ev_txt",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 997,
      "width": 1040,
      "height": 95,
      "text": "1. Read NEXT_EXPERIMENT.md — the only plan to execute\n2. Edit train.py — one controlled change, no side quests\n3. git add train.py + commit: \"experiment: [action_type] - hypothesis\"\n4. python3 train.py > run.log 2>&1\n5. If crash: max 1 repair attempt  (2 total tries, then STOP)\n6. Emit:  RUN_COMPLETE:<commit>  or  RUN_FAILED:<commit> <reason>",
      "originalText": "1. Read NEXT_EXPERIMENT.md — the only plan to execute\n2. Edit train.py — one controlled change, no side quests\n3. git add train.py + commit: \"experiment: [action_type] - hypothesis\"\n4. python3 train.py > run.log 2>&1\n5. If crash: max 1 repair attempt  (2 total tries, then STOP)\n6. Emit:  RUN_COMPLETE:<commit>  or  RUN_FAILED:<commit> <reason>",
