    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s3_rev_ev_txt",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 1283,
      "width": 1040,
      "height": 135,
      "text": "Phase 1 — Independent Assessment  (BEFORE reading the plan)\n  Run anomaly + all mandatory tools → parse metrics → compute Δ vs best_prior\n  Write REVIEW.md §Independent Assessment with preliminary verdict\nPhase 2 — Plan Comparison  (NOW reads NEXT_EXPERIMENT.md)\n  Expected Δ vs actual Δ → hypothesis confirmed or falsified?\nPhase 3 — Verdict + State Updates\n  keep if Δ > 0 AND no mandatory tool flagged regression AND not anomaly\n  keep → register >= 1 assumption in ASSUMPTION_REGISTER.md  (MANDATORY)\n  discard → scan for falsified assumptions, append DEAD_ENDS.md",
      "originalText": "Phase 1 — Independent Assessment  (BEFORE reading the plan)\n  Run anomaly + all mandatory tools → parse metrics → compute Δ vs best_prior\n  Write REVIEW.md §Independent Assessment with preliminary verdict\nPhase 2 — Plan Comparison  (NOW reads NEXT_EXPERIMENT.md)\n  Expected Δ vs actual Δ → hypothesis confirmed or falsified?\nPhase 3 — Verdict + State Updates\n  keep if Δ > 0 AND no mandatory tool flagged regression AND not anomaly\n  keep → register >= 1 assumption in ASSUMPTION_REGISTER.md  (MANDATORY)\n  discard → scan for falsified assumptions, append DEAD_ENDS.md",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "strokeColor": "#22c55e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
