    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "s6_design_principles",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 2390,
      "width": 1900,
      "height": 50,
      "text": "DESIGN PRINCIPLES:  Artifact-First (all state on disk)  ·  Producer ≠ Verifier (4 distinct roles)  ·  Contracts Sticky (C3 to change)\nReason Strategically, Compute Tactically (LLM reasons, tools compute)  ·  Progressive Complexity (Historian only on trigger, not every round)  ·  One Commit Per Experiment",
      "originalText": "DESIGN PRINCIPLES:  Artifact-First (all state on disk)  ·  Producer ≠ Verifier (4 distinct roles)  ·  Contracts Sticky (C3 to change)\nReason Strategically, Compute Tactically (LLM reasons, tools compute)  ·  Progressive Complexity (Historian only on trigger, not every round)  ·  One Commit Per Experiment",
