      "id": "s7_role_separation",
      "x": 1650,
      "y": 490,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "ROLE SEPARATION\n(Producer ≠ Verifier)\n\nPlanner designs experiments\nExecutor implements + runs\nReviewer evaluates evidence\nHistorian synthesizes patterns\n\nEach role writes ONLY its\nowned artifacts",
