      "x": 1650,
      "y": 680,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "META-COGNITIVE FEEDBACK\n\nAssumptions surface implicit\nbeliefs on every keep verdict.\n\nPatterns extract cross-round\nstructural regularities.\n\nStrategy Memo diagnoses\nbottlenecks for the Planner.",
