      "id": "s7_git_explain",
      "x": 1650,
      "y": 1700,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "GIT AS STATE MACHINE\n\nOne commit per experiment.\nKeep = commit stays.\nDiscard = git reset --hard.\nCampaign branch isolates\nfrom main until best found.",
